{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play various playground games as hamsters in this silly online party game. Feel the adrenaline as you outrun taggers, push your way to the top in king of the hill, express yourself with the customizer, and goof off between games. Hamster Hustle is a perfect game for game nights, streaming, casual competition, or if you ever just want to laugh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hamsters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 16-player public and private lobbies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tag and king of the hill modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can floss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick, 5 minute games (adjustable in game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ maps of various sizes and style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hamsters :)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597930?t=1773971059","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597930?t=1773971059","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597930/b8ee4a61375812a19e2eb5f58ef0868bf5772fcf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773971059","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597930/b8ee4a61375812a19e2eb5f58ef0868bf5772fcf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773971059","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play various playground games as hamsters in this silly online party game. Feel the adrenaline as yo